{"name":"Wink","hex":"#7792af","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"wink","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To close one's eyes in sleep.","To close one's eyes."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of winking (a blinking of only one eye), or a message sent by winking.","A brief period of sleep; especially forty winks."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wink"}],"entries":[{"title":"Wink","blocks":[{"text":"A wink is a facial expression made by briefly closing one eye. A wink is an informal mode of non-verbal communication usually signaling shared hidden knowledge or intent. However, it is ambiguous by itself and highly dependent upon additional context, without which a wink could become misinterpreted or even nonsensical. For example, in some regions of the world, a wink may be considered rude or offensive. Depending on the relationship of the people involved, a wink could possibly constitute a sexual gesture."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Gale_Henry.jpg/330px-Gale_Henry.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wink","wikidata":"Q1194966"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Gwyneth-Llewelyn-Winking-January-2015-712x712.gif/500px-Gwyneth-Llewelyn-Winking-January-2015-712x712.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Gwyneth-Llewelyn-Winking-January-2015-712x712.gif/500px-Gwyneth-Llewelyn-Winking-January-2015-712x712.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An avatar from Second Life winking","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGwyneth-Llewelyn-Winking-January-2015-712x712.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Camila_smile.jpg/500px-Camila_smile.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Camila_smile.jpg/1280px-Camila_smile.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Camila_smile.jpg/500px-Camila_smile.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Labrador Retriever winking","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACamila_smile.jpg"}],"sounds":{"wink":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/En-us-wink.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d2/En-us-wink.ogg/En-us-wink.ogg.mp3"}]}}}